            "review_title": "Review at Crazy Crab Phú Quốc Seafood",
            "review_text": "Journey38049449985\n18 contributions\n0\nHải sản rất tươi và NGON. Chuyến đi tuyệt vời!\nJan 2024 • Family\nExtremely satisfied and delighted with the food and service. Compared to many other restaurants and eateries in Vietnam, this restaurant is truly a gem. Peaceful environment filled with attentive, friendly, and well-mannered staffs.\nThe food is definitely of good taste and quality. I highly recommend any visitors to this island to mark this in your itinerary.\nKudos to the entire team - from the restaurant management, kitchen crew, to the service staffs.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 3, 2024\nDavid Nguyen\nThank you for sharing your experience with us. We're glad to know that you fully enjoyed your dinner at Crazy Crab. We wish you a happy day today and see you soon!\nRead more\nWritten January 10, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
